WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.125
The text-input page provides fields for the descriptions and conditions
required by the pipeline in use.

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:21.042
A first-frame input is useful when you want an image to define the opening
composition.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:32.992
Supported reference media depend on the pipeline; this walkthrough only
inspects the settings and does not create a new video.

00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:44.230
The first data-preparation step opens video scene analysis, but no
analysis is run here.

00:00:45.292 --> 00:00:55.079
This page is for reviewing and editing analysis results; no results have
been loaded for this walkthrough.

00:00:56.167 --> 00:01:06.383
This step creates scene descriptions; it does not create subtitles to
display in the video.

00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:17.478
The final page pairs videos with descriptions; no files are exported and
no model is trained here.
